Subject: [PATCH 16/18] Web client: workstream 20's NFT residents (web part of
 dc55f159), on workstream 4's 8e96f24d

Taken as it is from origin/claude/funny-wozniak-cy4n64 dc55f159
(git diff 92142932 dc55f159 -- permutation-server/web), applied 3-way.
Workstream 20's program, ABI crates, gateway routes and tests are not
taken here. Conflicts resolved:
- controller.mjs refresh: the viewer checks of ef63544c kept; /h/me and the
  quota read for 20's viewerKey()/viewerCitizen().
- controller.mjs connect: ef63544c's syncConnectedWallet kept; 20's
  nft-login and nft-logout actions added (loading the NFTs on a wallet
  change follows in workstream 07's next commit).
- fi18n.mjs: both error tables (ContinuousWorld and 20's 170-175).
- abi-v2-errors.mjs (generated): the union by code (ours plus 170-175).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
